{
 "list": "T-3103 masked-feature probe: masked connectives, negators and comparison words (plan rev 15 s5.2 item 3)",
 "rule": "Masked from every probe feature; every n-gram containing a masked word is itself masked, including across punctuation. Matching is case-insensitive on whole words, and multi-word entries mask their whole span.",
 "connectives": ["when", "whenever", "once", "as soon as", "the moment", "if", "after", "afterward", "afterwards",
